    "detailed_description": "<h1>Infinite Demo V2 is live!</h1><p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >05/02/2024</h2>If you haven't checked it out yet, download our infinite demo <i>now with feedback survey </i>- before we change it to a finite demo at our next major update!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/0ff6e22eb797f0a310862facc27331ec.avif?t=1738873530\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2>Hone your precision platforming, unlock and buff your skills in the constellation skill tree, never get bored or frustrated with our real-time dynamic difficulty balancing system, enjoy hand drawn character animations, and discover a poignant story of a fractured soul facing the ultimate shadow...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features </h2>Single player, flow-centric, atmospheric, HD-2D, procedural rooftop runner with a vibing soundtrack; a true, updated homage to classics like Canabalt and Vector.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It's a Vibe</h2>Jump. React. Upgrade. Flow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/cd84bd8e2897603483a9ed9574e8464f.poster.avif?t=1738873530\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/cd84bd8e2897603483a9ed9574e8464f.webm?t=1738873530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/cd84bd8e2897603483a9ed9574e8464f.mp4?t=1738873530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >React</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/ba27a614db577efcdf290b7b6759be22.poster.avif?t=1738873530\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/ba27a614db577efcdf290b7b6759be22.webm?t=1738873530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/ba27a614db577efcdf290b7b6759be22.mp4?t=1738873530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/feff9134745c0350569065d74395a52e.poster.avif?t=1738873530\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/feff9134745c0350569065d74395a52e.webm?t=1738873530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/feff9134745c0350569065d74395a52e.mp4?t=1738873530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flow</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/0fde9c56ac5ce3f962d563a21cc2d495.poster.avif?t=1738873530\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/0fde9c56ac5ce3f962d563a21cc2d495.webm?t=1738873530\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514310/extras/0fde9c56ac5ce3f962d563a21cc2d495.mp4?t=1738873530\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
